    AbilityLabel: 'Peck'
    AbilityDescription: 'Hold RT to see the aim line, let go for three quick shots, every 1 s. Each Space card the Ratel makes (Genesis Lance, Little Bang Grenade, Particle Harmonizer, Fugacity Discharger, Sepia Drone, Thruster Swarm, Hexapod Eyelet Jet) banks three uses on RT; the newest fires first. Hold both triggers to cancel.'
    Input: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
